{
    "title": "Cat Tiles: Cute Piano Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Cat Tiles: Cute Piano Game, amazing piano fun with your cat friend. Enjoy yourself in the world of lovely, colorful cats while relaxing to exciting music that follows the rhythm of the music.\r\nCute cats can let you immerse yourself in new song melodies, renew your soul, and feel cheerful during the rest of the day.\r\n\r\nThis relaxing\u00a0cat game is\u00a0for all ages, especially cat lovers all around the world.\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\n- Tap the cat piano to play the piano and make amazing sounds. \r\n-  You will lose if you miss a tile \r\n- Play the magic piano well and try to complete magic songs with 3 stars or 3 crowns to get more rewards.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Relieve your stress by listening to the chilling sounds\r\n- Play a variety of musical genres: Pop, K-Pop, J-Pop, rock, electro swing, EDM, house and many more!\r\n- Play fun and addictive mini-games\r\n- Easy, medium and hard levels\r\n- Compete in the leaderboard for very exclusive reward\r\n\r\nPlay piano game, cat tiles for free! Cute cats are waiting for you.\r\nIf you enjoy it, download the game now!\r\n\r\nSupport:\r\nAny problems? Send feedback to us: wingsmob@outlook.com or in the game by going to Settings > FAQ and Support.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://wingsmob.net/terms-of-use.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://wingsmob.net/privacy-policy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Cat Tiles: Cute Piano Game, amazing piano fun with your cat friend. Enjoy yourself in the world of lovely, colorful cats while relaxing to exciting music that follows the rhythm of the music.<br>Cute cats can let you immerse yourself in new song melodies, renew your soul, and feel cheerful during the rest of the day.<br><br>This relaxing\u00a0cat game is\u00a0for all ages, especially cat lovers all around the world.<br><br>How to Play:<br>- Tap the cat piano to play the piano and make amazing sounds. <br>-  You will lose if you miss a tile <br>- Play the magic piano well and try to complete magic songs with 3 stars or 3 crowns to get more rewards.<br><br>Game features:<br>- Relieve your stress by listening to the chilling sounds<br>- Play a variety of musical genres: Pop, K-Pop, J-Pop, rock, electro swing, EDM, house and many more!<br>- Play fun and addictive mini-games<br>- Easy, medium and hard levels<br>- Compete in the leaderboard for very exclusive reward<br><br>Play piano game, cat tiles for free! Cute cats are waiting for you.<br>If you enjoy it, download the game now!<br><br>Support:<br>Any problems? Send feedback to us: wingsmob@outlook.com or in the game by going to Settings &gt; FAQ and Support.<br><br>Terms of use: https://wingsmob.net/terms-of-use.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://wingsmob.net/privacy-policy.html",
